Combined with bst-iaz-sql-dev-geo over the same period: £63,092.36. The arc11x environment is approximately one third of the total.

⚠️ Monthly billing is flat throughout. This does not indicate usage. Four of the six databases are DTU-tier and bill at a fixed rate regardless of activity; the two serverless databases have auto-pause disabled (autoPauseDelay = -1). Cost data cannot establish whether the environment was in use.

5. Forward cost if no action is taken

At current rates, approximately £2,200/month / £26,400/year continues to be incurred on the arc11x environment, in its present Inaccessible state.

Not established: the date and cause of the Key Vault access loss; whether the arc11x environment is still required; the TDE configuration of bsttestserver.

